      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果要拓展“连系”……\n在“日本杯”跑得“稍微开心一点”\n或许真的会比较好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30bd8bfa143ad22491347785b51689d7185caa56f60525e7836193ae7771ef25",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
