    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77df11b70e35e07dc98a3210",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "称霸“日本杯”的新宇宙发现\n自己能够进一步拓展“连系”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "893b8844dad7a2b155b8339f8bc0a0ba287556d393be760a70613ebe340491a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105438.json",
      "json_path": [
