    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81ba8c05cd045266c0b20d6b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不只朋友，还包括“大王”与“奇异点”……\n即使是自己迎战的对手，\n也能互相传达“爱”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "506d10ab73f58d42908f0abf51bcdb360069197fae7d36875e98d79288fd452d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
