      "uid": "zhcn:0c9dec9fc15afbb45f5ed5f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "除此之后，\n结束比赛的新宇宙\n还有一件事想告诉训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25ff47be01755f6826daba284884292ff897e90e03043114de2b01f23da0d2dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105438.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
