      "uid": "zhcn:0a3bb0911cbabf1053d188db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙终于回来了。\n她带着在其他宇宙没能献上的胜利，\n回到原本应该要继续下去的时间轴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79f50caf508785ba879233cdaa1bbbeb36015a0bc63bfdd4d8f9f10ec47664fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
